  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia / AI-based Electric Two-Wheeler and Charging Station Operation Optimization Solution Demonstration / 36 months / 800 million KRW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of partnership and secure revenue for building an Electric Two-Wheeler Financial Platform, development of AI solutions for the Electric Two-Wheeler Financial Platform, delivery of Electric Two-Wheeler Financial Platform, and expansion of achievement across Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance the efficiency of electric two-wheeler infrastructure through AI-based optimization solutions, reduce operational costs, and accelerate EV adoption by establishing a battery-driven financial framework&#xc804;&#xae30; &#xc774;&#xb95c;&#xcc28; &#xbc30;&#xd130;&#xb9ac; &#xd30c;&#xc774;&#xb0b8;&#xc2f1;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xbc30;&#xd130;&#xb9ac; &#xcda9;&#xc804;&#xc18c; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xc0ac;&#xc758; &#xc790;&#xae30;&#xc790;&#xbcf8;&#xd22c;&#xc785; &#xbe44;&#xc728; 10%&#xac10;&#xc18c;, &#xc800;&#xd0c4;&#xc18c; &#xad50;&#xd1b5;&#xc218;&#xb2e8;(&#xc804;&#xae30; &#xc774;&#xb95c;&#xcc28;)&#xc744; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xd558;&#xb294; &#xbaa8;&#xbe4c;&#xb9ac;&#xd2f0; &#xd50c;&#xb7ab;&#xd3fc; &#xb77c;&#xc774;&#xb354; 3,000&#xba85; &#xc99d;&#xac00;</narrative>
